{% comment %}
  Abimra order note — a line item property on the product form.

  Whatever is typed here is attached to that line of the order and travels
  the whole way: cart, checkout, the order in the admin, the confirmation
  email and any export. It sits under the product name on the order, so a
  request is read against the item it belongs to rather than the order as
  a whole.

  The field lives outside <product-form> in the DOM, so it carries the
  form attribute to tie it back. Without that it is simply not submitted.

  The property name is what the customer and the merchant both see as the
  label on the order. Prefixing it with an underscore would hide it from
  the customer while keeping it on the order; it is deliberately visible
  here, so the customer can check their own request in the cart.

  Shopify drops a property whose value is blank, so an untouched field
  leaves no empty row on the order.

  Accepts:
  - id:            {String} block id, to keep label/field pairs unique
  - form_id:       {String} id of the product form this belongs to
  - label:         {String}
  - property_name: {String} what the note is called on the order
  - placeholder:   {String}
  - help:          {String} small print under the field
  - rows:          {Number}
  - maxlength:     {Number} 0 for no limit

  Usage:
  {% render 'abmira-note', id: block.id, form_id: product_form_id, label: l %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign field_id = 'AbNote-' | append: id
  assign name = property_name | default: 'Special requirements'
  assign rows = rows | default: 3
-%}

<div class="ab-note">
  <label class="ab-note-label" for="{{ field_id }}">
    {{ label | default: 'Add a note' | escape }}
  </label>

  <textarea
    id="{{ field_id }}"
    class="ab-note-field"
    name="properties[{{ name | escape }}]"
    form="{{ form_id }}"
    rows="{{ rows }}"
    {% if maxlength != blank and maxlength > 0 %}maxlength="{{ maxlength }}"{% endif %}
    {% if placeholder != blank %}placeholder="{{ placeholder | escape }}"{% endif %}
    {% if help != blank %}aria-describedby="{{ field_id }}-help"{% endif %}
  ></textarea>

  {%- if help != blank -%}
    <small class="ab-note-help" id="{{ field_id }}-help">{{ help | escape }}</small>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
